The community centers around the Sistema Nacional de Salud (SNS), which is the public healthcare system in Spain, and its role in managing dysphagia through various regulations, clinical studies, and dietary provisions. Key entities include social networks, clinical studies, and autonomous communities, all of which interact with the SNS to address health concerns related to dysphagia and nutritional needs.

