Patients with inflammatory bowel diseases and other inflammatory conditions may require specialized nutritional management to address their dietary needs. Artificial nutrition can be a critical component of their treatment plan, helping to prevent malnutrition and support recovery. The focus on inflammatory conditions highlights the diverse applications of nutritional support in clinical practice. [Data: Reports (1110); Entities (1635); Relationships (6756, 6800)]

