Healthcare professionals, including dietitians and medical doctors, play a vital role in planning and managing artificial nutrition for patients. Their expertise is essential in assessing nutritional needs, developing treatment plans, and monitoring patient progress. The collaborative approach among healthcare providers is crucial for ensuring effective nutritional support and improving patient outcomes. [Data: Reports (1110); Entities (2198, 1635); Relationships (6803, 6806)]# PACIENTES Nutritional Support Community

