Nutrition Day, organized by ESPEN, is an initiative aimed at evaluating the nutritional status of patients admitted to hospitals across Europe. This initiative raises awareness about the prevalence of malnutrition and its implications for patient care. By collecting data on nutritional practices and outcomes, Nutrition Day helps to inform healthcare providers about the effectiveness of their interventions and highlights areas for improvement. The initiative's findings contribute to the ongoing efforts to combat malnutrition in healthcare settings, reinforcing ESPEN's commitment to enhancing nutritional care [Data: Reports (685); Entities (8074); Relationships (2966, 2946, 16970, +more)].# Nutrition and Medical Care Community

